msgid "Redstone Link"
msgstr "无线红石信号终端"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:4
msgid "Redstone links enable remote transmission and reception of redstone signals, as described in their in-game ponder. When placed in factory controllers, they may be connected with other components with redstone capabilities, allowing them to interoperate with contraptions outside the factory controller."
msgstr "无线红石信号终端可以远程发送和接收红石信号，可参阅游戏内“思索”。将其放入工厂控制台后，可通过红石连接与其他组件相连，从而让控制台内部组件与外部装置互相协作。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redstone links placed in factory controllers"
msgstr "在工厂控制台中放置的无线红石信号终端"

