#. type: #principle
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:25
msgid "A redstone link has 2 modes of operation:"
msgstr "无线红石信号终端有两种模式："

#. type: horizontal
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:28
msgid "Sends the powered state of its incoming redstone connections to other redstone links on the same channel."
msgstr "把输入红石连接的充能状态发送给同频道的其他无线红石信号终端。"

#. type: horizontal
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:29
msgid "Receives from other redstone links on the same channel. If any of them is powered, it powers its outgoing redstone connections."
msgstr "接收同频道其他终端的状态。只要其中任意一个处于充能状态，就会使自身的输出红石连接充能。"

#. type: horizontal
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:31
msgid "Redstone links are distinguished by channels, which consist of 2 item types. Each channel carries a redstone signal independently of the others. Examples of distinct channels are:"
msgstr "每个频道由两种物品共同确定，不同组合彼此独立。例如以下频道均不相同："

#. type: horizontal
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:33
msgid "(Oak Plank, Cobblestone)"
msgstr "（橡木木板，圆石）"

#. type: horizontal
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:34
msgid "(Oak Plank, Air)"
msgstr "（橡木木板，空气）"

#. type: horizontal
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:35
msgid "(Air, Oak Plank)"
msgstr "（空气，橡木木板）"

#. type: horizontal
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:36
msgid "(Air, Air)"
msgstr "（空气，空气）"

#. type: #configuration
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:41
msgid "After placing a redstone link on the virtual board, clicking the component opens its configuration screen."
msgstr "将无线红石信号终端放到虚拟面板后，点击组件以打开设置界面。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redstone link settings"
msgstr "无线红石信号终端设置界面"

#. type: #configuration
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:47
msgid "❶ ❷ Channel:: Place an item, or drag a ghost item from JEI, to set the channel of the redstone link."
msgstr "❶ ❷ 频道:: 放入物品，或从 JEI 拖入虚拟物品，以设置终端频道。"

#. type: #configuration
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:50
msgid "❸ Relocate button:: Click to move the location of this redstone link on the virtual board."
msgstr "❸ 移动组件按钮:: 在虚拟面板上移动此终端。"

#. type: #configuration
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:53
msgid "❹ Add connection button:: Click to connect to other components via redstone. Directions of connections are decided automatically. Send-mode links may only have incoming connections, receive-mode links may only have outgoing connections."
msgstr "❹ 新建连接按钮:: 通过红石连接到其他组件。连接方向会自动确定，发送模式只能接收输入连接，接收模式只能建立输出连接。"

#. type: #configuration
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:56
msgid "❺ Mode switch:: Click to switch between send image:btn-send-mode.png[,18,18] and receive image:btn-receive-mode.png[,18,18] modes."
msgstr "❺ 模式切换:: 在发送 image:btn-send-mode.png[,18,18] 和接收 image:btn-receive-mode.png[,18,18] 模式之间切换。"

#. type: #configuration
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:59
msgid "❻ Confirm button:: Click to confirm settings and close the screen."
msgstr "❻ 确认按钮:: 保存设置并关闭界面。"

#. type: Title ==
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Signal Strength"
msgstr "信号强度"

#. type: #signal-strength
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:64
msgid "Inside factory controllers, redstone connections do not carry strength information of redstone signals. Instead, connect to redstone links via number connections to send and receive signal strengths, represented as integers between 0-15."
msgstr "在工厂控制台中，红石连接不传递红石信号的强度信息。请使用数字连接来发送和接收信号强度，信号强度以 0 到 15 之间的整数表示。"

#. type: #signal-strength
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:66
msgid "When connected as the sink of number connections, a redstone link clamps the number between 0-15 and rounds down, before sending the signal strength. The largest number is selected among multiple inputs, and a powered redstone connection is considered to have a strength of 15."
msgstr "作为数字连接的接收端时，无线红石信号终端会将数字限制在 0 到 15 之间并向下取整，然后再发送信号强度。有多个输入时，最大的数值会被选择。充能的红石连接视的强度被视为 15。"

#. type: #signal-strength
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:68
msgid "A client setting can be turned on to display the signal strengths on the labels of redstone links."
msgstr "有一个客户端设置在开启时，可以使信号强度显示在无线红石信号终端的标签上。"

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/redstone-link.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sending the xref:arithmetic-tube.adoc[sum] of signal strengths from 2 other redstone links"
msgstr "发送另外两个无线红石信号终端的信号强度之xref:arithmetic-tube.adoc[和]"
